projects.description:
Organization Gala IUT Annecy held Thursday, March 12, 2009 at "Espace Rencontre" in Annecy-le-Vieux.
Complete creation of the project financing package, folder estimates, contractor management, research sponsorship, prevention organization, assembly and disassembly of the room, managing the evening.

Some figures:
* 3 organizers;
* 1 year of preparation;
* 800 festive;
* A staff of 80 people to manage the Gala evening;
* 1 Operation "Captain Evening";
* One memorable evening.

Establishment of an association for the sustainability of the project.

